      "content": "Here are my responses to each objection:\n\nCONCEDED obj_initial_a_0: The Go version update is indeed a significant change that requires thorough testing as pointed out by the other reviewer.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_1: The kube-cross image version update is coordinated with the Go version update and follows Kubernetes' standard update practices.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_2: The distroless-iptables and go-runner version updates are part of the coordinated dependency updates and need verification.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_3: The multiple dependency version updates in dependencies.yaml are necessary to maintain compatibility with the new Go version.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_4: Go 1.26 could potentially introduce breaking changes as it's a minor version update, which is why thorough testing is required.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_5: All dependent images do need compatibility verification when updating core components like Go version and base images.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_6: The distroless-iptables update is indeed a minor version bump (v0.8.14 \u2192 v0.9.6) according to semantic versioning.\n\nCONCEDED obj_initial_a_7: The multiple file changes are primarily import reordering as correctly noted by the other reviewer.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_8: Full CI testing is absolutely required for a Go version update to verify compatibility across all components.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_9: The distroless-iptables update should be verified for behavior changes as it's a critical networking component.\n\nCONCEDED obj_initial_a_10: The mock file changes are indeed import reordering with no functional changes.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_11: The version updates are properly coordinated across multiple files, which is good practice for maintainability.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_12: Verifying all CI tests pass with new versions is a standard requirement for version updates.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_13: Documenting the version update rationale in the commit message improves maintainability and auditability.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_14: Checking Kubernetes support policy for Go 1.26 is necessary to ensure the update is supported.\n\nCARRIED obj_initial_a_15: Reviewing changelogs for distroless-iptables v0.9.6 is important to identify any potential breaking changes."
